  diseaseId: peptic_ulcer
  diseaseName: "PEPT\u0130K \xDCLSER"
  generalInfo: "Peptik \xFClser, mide veya duodenum mukozas\u0131nda geli\u015Fen
    yara ile karakterize bir sindirim sistemi hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r. Hastalarda
    mide a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131, yanma ve bulant\u0131 g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "\xDCst mide a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 var olmas\u0131, a\u011Fr\u0131
    a\xE7ken art\u0131yor olmas\u0131, gece a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 mevcut olmas\u0131
    ve \u015Fi\u015Fkinlik hissi var olmas\u0131 peptik \xFClserde s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen
    belirtilerdendir. Baz\u0131 hastalarda i\u015Ftah azalm\u0131\u015F olabilir."
